     * Very long words, such as URLs will <em>not</em> be wrapped.</p>
     *
     * <p>Leading spaces on a new line are stripped.
     * Trailing spaces are not stripped.</p>
     *
     * <table border="1">
     *  <caption>Examples</caption>
     *  <tr>
     *   <th>input</th>
     *   <th>wrapLength</th>
     *   <th>result</th>
     *  </tr>
